cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AI Agile"
abstract: >-
  A complete, self-contained agentic framework for a product-led software
  development lifecycle, added to any project repo as a single git
  submodule. A deterministic Python orchestrator (no LLM in the routing
  path) reads GitHub issue status labels, consults a dependency graph, and
  invokes specialised AI agents that move each change from issue to
  shipped, tested, documented code, with humans approving at well-defined
  gates.
authors:
